# Biome 1, level 20 — The Whole Valley
#
# The last board of the biome asks for everything it has taught. A crooked water run four conduits
# long on the right, a wind trunk on the left that forks to two hubs and is paid for twice, and a
# short crystal pair between them.
#
# Everything together is 745 and the target is 600, so one of the three can be left alone — but only
# one, and not the wind. Its fork is worth 364 by itself, more than the other two combined.

